 "description": "Bundled risk context for one or more coins: price, funding APR, deterministic funding_paying_side, funding_receiving_side, carry_if_long and carry_if_short fields, daily/weekly trend, sentiment stance, and BTC correlation. Funding applies to perpetual positions only; spot positions neither pay nor receive it. Relay the carry fields exactly rather than inferring direction from crowding. The best single tool for \"should I be worried about X\".",
